BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 452.77 Tm (Title: Four shortcuts that preserve the evidence chain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 437.55 Tm (Body: Reduce repeat research without treating a convenient secondary feed as controlling evidence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 422.32 Tm (Items: Save the appointment order and issued letters as separate evidence objects; a docket entry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 407.10 Tm (announcing appointment can precede accessible letters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 391.87 Tm (Index recorder instruments by county plus instrument number, because identical instrument numbers can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 376.65 Tm (occur in different jurisdictions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 361.42 Tm (Ask referral attorneys which case events justify a property discussion; configure alerts for those events) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 346.20 Tm (instead of sending every docket change.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 330.97 Tm (Maintain a county-specific missing-document queue with clerk request dates, assigned researchers, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 315.75 Tm (transaction decision each missing item blocks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 293.52 Tm (2. Construct an enrichment waterfall with reversible identity decisions) Tj ET
